---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Engineer Tech AI | Manufacturing Test, Automation & AI Solutions</title>

    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f4f7fb;
        color: #102033;
      }

      header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #061a33, #0a5bd3);
        color: white;
        padding: 90px 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 52px;
        margin: 0;
      }

      header h2 {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 400;
        margin: 18px 0;
      }

      .hero {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        font-size: 20px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 26px;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 55px 24px;
      }

      .section-title {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .section-subtitle {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto 35px;
        color: #4b5b70;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(245px, 1fr));
        gap: 22px;
      }

      .card {
        background: white;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 26px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        border-top: 4px solid #0a5bd3;
      }

      .card h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #0a5bd3;
      }

      .card p, li {
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: #3b4a5c;
      }

      ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
      }

      .dark {
        background: #061a33;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 60px 24px;
      }

      .dark p {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: auto;
        font-size: 19px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .cta {
        background: white;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 45px 25px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 18px;
        background: #0a5bd3;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 14px 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      footer {
        background: #061a33;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 30px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header>
      <h1>Engineer Tech AI</h1>
      <h2>Manufacturing Test, Automation & AI Solutions</h2>

      <p class="hero">
        Helping electronics manufacturers improve production reliability,
        automate engineering workflows, and solve complex test challenges.
      </p>

      <div class="badge">
        16+ Years Supporting Medical • Aerospace • Defense • High-Reliability Electronics
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Consulting Services</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Practical engineering support for manufacturing teams that need help with test systems,
          automation, troubleshooting, documentation, and AI-powered workflow improvement.
        </p>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Manufacturing Test Engineering</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Production test systems</li>
              <li>Test process optimization</li>
              <li>Validation and troubleshooting</li>
              <li>Production support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>LabVIEW & TestStand</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Automated test development</li>
              <li>Debugging and support</li>
              <li>Sequence improvement</li>
              <li>Test platform modernization</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>PXI & Instrumentation</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>PXI troubleshooting</li>
              <li>Instrumentation support</li>
              <li>Calibration issue investigation</li>
              <li>System integration support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Process Automation</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Workflow automation</li>
              <li>Reporting improvements</li>
              <li>Documentation systems</li>
              <li>Manufacturing support tools</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>AI Workflow Integration</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>AI-assisted documentation</li>
              <li>OCR and data extraction</li>
              <li>Internal knowledge systems</li>
              <li>Engineering workflow support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Technical Problem Solving</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Root-cause analysis</li>
              <li>Quality and production support</li>
              <li>Electronics troubleshooting</li>
              <li>Class 3 rework experience</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="dark">
        <h2>Experience Where Quality, Traceability, and Uptime Matter</h2>
        <p>
          Engineer Tech AI brings hands-on experience across regulated and high-reliability
          electronics manufacturing environments, including medical, aerospace, defense,
          military, industrial, wireless, and contract manufacturing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Industries Supported</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Built for organizations that need dependable engineering support in production,
          test, automation, and manufacturing operations.
        </p>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card"><h3>Medical Devices</h3><p>Quality-focused electronics manufacturing environments.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Aerospace</h3><p>High-reliability production and test requirements.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Defense & Military</h3><p>Demanding electronics and test environments.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Class 3 Electronics</h3><p>High-reliability PCB rework and production standards.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Industrial Electronics</h3><p>Production, troubleshooting, and process improvement.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Contract Manufacturing</h3><p>Support for fast-moving manufacturing teams.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container">
        <div class="cta">
          <h2>Need Manufacturing Test or Automation Support?</h2>
          <p>
            Engineer Tech AI is available for project-based consulting,
            contract support, and workflow automation initiatives.
          </p>
          <a class="button" href="mailto:info@engineertech.ai">Request a Consultation</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      Engineer Tech AI © 2026
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
